Route 53 (yourdomain.com)
          │
     AWS ALB (public)
          │  HTTPS (TLS)
   ┌──────┴───────────────┐
   │                      │
Private Subnets (multi-AZ, with NAT)
   │
ECS Cluster on EC2 (RHEL 9/8)  <— Docker + ECS agent
   ├─ Service A: api-gateway (TaskDef + TargetGroup)
   ├─ Service B: users
   ├─ Service C: orders
   └─ Service D: payments
   │
   ├─ Service discovery: AWS Cloud Map
   ├─ Logs: CloudWatch Logs
   ├─ Tracing: AWS X-Ray (optional)
   └─ Metrics: CloudWatch + Container Insights
   │
Data Layer (private)
   ├─ Amazon RDS (Aurora/MySQL/Postgres)
   ├─ ElastiCache Redis (sessions/queues)
   └─ S3 (assets/backups)